    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938210/extras/28d380e1ad626d8c1ebfc6cab3f2f2a5.poster.avif?t=1715154925\" width=732 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938210/extras/28d380e1ad626d8c1ebfc6cab3f2f2a5.webm?t=1715154925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938210/extras/28d380e1ad626d8c1ebfc6cab3f2f2a5.mp4?t=1715154925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fighting Frontier is a small comedy 3D third-person action game where you play as an event staff member.<br><br>- Take down troublemakers with your fists.<br>- Fix broken roadblocks before more enemies appear.<br>- Gather energy drinks to regain life points.<br>- Change your character's appearance in cosplay room. <br><br>The game contains 3 levels and the estimated gameplay duration is 5 minutes.<br><br>Click LMB to Attack<br>Hold F to fix broken roadblock<br>Press Esc to quit application",
